  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RESILAND CA+ Program Tajikistan Resilient Landscape Restoration Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective is to increase the area under sustainable landscape management in selected locations in Tajikistan, and promote Tajikistan&apos;s collaboration with Central Asia countries on transboundary landscape restoration.</narrative>
  </description>
